# Project hygiene

## Before finishing a feature

1. Run `npm run audit -- --strict`
2. If you remove a feature, delete its engine, tests, i18n keys (`en.js` first), and tier flags — then `npm run sync:i18n`
3. Dashboard tools: each id in `modeExperience.js` needs exactly one handler in `DashboardTools.jsx`. Do not duplicate standalone tools inside grouped hubs.

## Dead code

- `npm run audit:orphans` — fails if `engines/` or `services/` files are only imported from `__tests__`
- `npm run audit:dead-code` — unmounted screens / orphan tool handlers
- `npm run audit:merge` — advisory; fold single-consumer helper panels when sensible
- `npm run audit:duplicates` — basename collisions (e.g. rename `netWorth/categories.js` → `wealthCategories.js`)
- `npm run audit:engine-tests` — engines missing dedicated `__tests__` files (target: 86/86)
- `npm run audit:engines` — test coverage + no React/UI imports in engines
- `npm run audit:complexity` — skeleton engines (&lt;40 lines) needing depth
- `npm run audit:notification-i18n` — `notifications.js` feed builders must use `titleKey` / `messageKey`, not hardcoded English
- `npm run audit:pro-features-built` — Pro/Power features in registry have UI wiring
- `npm run audit:docs-sync` — `09-implementation-status.md` matches shipped paths (no stale FamilyCommandCenter / HouseholdHubSection)
- `npm run audit:household` — family mode isolation + profile-scope + dependents editor wiring
- `npm run audit:pre-release` — gate + governance + docs-sync + engine tests before release

## Tool layout (Home)

10 tools: planner, advisor, loan, insurance, chit, bond, incomeTax, retirement, safety, **invest**.

- **Retirement** subtitle: EPF · PPF · NPS · gratuity (no FD/RD)
- **Invest & save**: SIP · FD · RD (voluntary savings moved from wrong parents)
- **Safety**: emergency fund only (no SIP)

## i18n

Source of truth: `src/i18n/messages/en.js`. Removing keys from `en.js` + `npm run sync:i18n` prunes all locales.

Notification feeds: engines return `{ titleKey, messageKey, messageParams?, suffixKey? }`; UI resolves via `translateNotification()` in `src/i18n/notificationLabels.js`.

## Do not leave

- Engines with tests but no UI wiring
- Duplicate settings tiles (e.g. Security + Privacy — merge under Privacy and security)
- Stale docs in `docs/09-implementation-status.md` after shipping features
